{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53594","headline":"咏廿四气诗 小雪十月中 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 小雪十月中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫怪虹无影，如今小雪时。\n阴阳依上下，寒暑喜分离。\n满月光天汉，长风响树枝。\n横琴对渌醑，犹（一作「独」）自歛愁眉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}